WEBVTT

00:10.866 --> 00:12.700
Got it, put it away quickly.

00:13.933 --> 00:15.500
Four years have passed in a flash.

00:27.766 --> 00:30.100
Mom will be home in two hours to cook.

00:30.233 --> 00:31.533
Order a pizza.

00:31.533 --> 00:33.233
and throw the box downstairs.

00:33.233 --> 00:34.733
There should be enough time.

00:45.733 --> 00:47.933
Wow,the lake water is so beautiful.

00:48.166 --> 00:49.600
The sea water is even more beautiful.

00:50.266 --> 00:51.566
I like water

00:54.066 --> 00:54.966
Producer,

00:54.966 --> 00:56.266
let's shoot here.

00:56.266 --> 00:58.066
I think this scene is quite good.

01:06.000 --> 01:07.966
This is the last resort at this stage.

01:08.233 --> 01:09.600
If the preparations works for you,

01:09.633 --> 01:10.500
it's a happy ending.

01:10.766 --> 01:11.666
If there is rejection,

01:11.666 --> 01:12.866
you should also stay optimistic.

01:13.033 --> 01:14.566
One day, medicine will overcome it.

01:24.866 --> 01:25.866
Let me help you.

01:25.866 --> 01:26.933
Get up, kid.

01:27.066 --> 01:28.633
It's okay, I can get up by myself.

01:30.733 --> 01:32.733
If you go to junior high school in Tianjin,

01:32.733 --> 01:34.033
will you come back during summer vacation?

01:34.466 --> 01:36.733
may not come back from boarding school.

01:37.600 --> 01:39.000
Well, okay.

01:49.066 --> 01:50.533
Newcomer, it's almost lunch break.

01:50.533 --> 01:52.233
Let me show you around our company's canteen.

02:01.466 --> 02:02.966
Don't be nervous for your first day at Univ.

02:03.133 --> 02:05.233
Keep us updated when you arrive in Korea.

02:07.166 --> 02:08.600
I'm leaving.

02:09.633 --> 02:10.466
Why?

02:11.533 --> 02:13.033
Because I saw.

02:14.833 --> 02:16.633
I saw your background color.

02:17.966 --> 02:20.333
What color am I?

02:23.133 --> 02:24.333
I like water.

02:24.466 --> 02:25.600
and the sea.

02:26.400 --> 02:28.000
Sometimes it's blue,

02:28.266 --> 02:31.500
sometimes shining with gold brilliance under the sunset,

02:31.733 --> 02:34.866
and also reveals its deep darkness in the moonlight.

02:35.600 --> 02:38.533
The sea will accept every color given to it by the world,

02:38.900 --> 02:40.033
and reflects them,

02:40.466 --> 02:42.666
forming the sea in the eyes of others.

02:43.200 --> 02:46.633
But what is the original and eternal color of the sea?

02:47.333 --> 02:50.700
I think the true color of the sea may be

02:50.700 --> 02:52.700
the end of all colors mixed together.
